dicttool_aosp.jar

Source: https://github.com/remi0s/aosp-dictionary-tools
Source commit: 1e69dd2c04258e5e9e04bfb13b46faccf6a435b0
SHA-256: a8c5bd21f631ed0a92235d42d2fe83af5d70216172bf7e22781a9a946858237e
License: Apache License, Version 2.0

This prebuilt AOSP dictionary-tool distribution is vendored solely to create
and reproduce the format-202 LatinIME fixtures. Its makedict command is
invoked by build_language_pack.py; the resulting dictionaries are consumed by
the pinned AOSP LatinIME decoder.
